SUMMARY:IDz on Eclipse - Module 4 + 5: Remote Systems 1 + 2
DESCRIPTION:Connect to your shop's test LPAR and navigate libraries and data sets. Locate files in large PDSs\, Copy files from Mainframe <-> PC <->Mainframe. Search Remote libraries using powerful tools that allow you to access "found" source files with your mouse. Learn to utilize MVS File Filters and Retrieve Data Set for effective organization and access of z/OS resources. Create\, configuring and customize Property Groups for SYSLIB (COPY and INCLUDE search path definitions)\, PROC Search Path and Called Module Search Path definitions. Utilize Property Groups with: Show Dependencies and Remote Syntax Check.\n\nMeeting Link: https://ibm.biz/distance-learning-classroom\nMeeting ID: 294 075 380 443 8\nPasscode: Lq3ag6sG
LOCATION:Microsoft Teams - https://ibm.biz/distance-learning-classroom
STATUS:CONFIRMED
